n activated ability of an Elemental, Ceaseless Searblades gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Whenever you play an activated ability, if it isn't a mana ability, you may pay {2}. If you do, copy that ability. You may choose new targets for the copy.", 'You lose 2 life and draw two cards, then clash with an opponent. If you win, repeat this process. (Each clashing player reveals the top card of his or her library, then puts that card on the top or bottom. A player wins if his or her card had a higher converted mana cost.)', 'You may choose new targets for target instant or sorcery spell. Then copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'You may play the activated abilities of creatures you control as though those creatures had haste.\\n{1}, {T}: Untap target creature.', "{1}, Sacrifice Wanderer's Twig: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.", '{1}, {T}: You may play a nonland card from your hand without paying its mana cost if it has the same name as a spell that was played this turn.', '{1}{R}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Ashling the Pilgrim. If this is the third time this ability has resolved this turn, remove all +1/+1 counters from Ashling the Pilgrim, and it deals that much damage to each creature and each player.', '{1}{U}, {T}: You may tap or untap target creature.', '{1}{W}: Prevent all damage that would be dealt to target tapped Merfolk or Kithkin creature this turn.', '{2}: Target creature gains trample until end of turn. If this is the third time this ability has resolved this turn, you may add {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R}{R} to your mana pool.', '{2}{B}, Remove an Elf card in your graveyard from the game: Scarred Vinebreeder gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', '{2}{B}: Regenerate target Treefolk.', '{2}{R}: Creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn. If this is the third time this ability has resolved this turn, creatures you control gain first strike until end of turn.', '{3}, Sacrifice Herbal Poultice: Regenerate target creature.', '{3}{R}: Flamekin Spitfire deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', '{B}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Facevaulter gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', '{G}, {T}: Look at the top two cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', '{G}, {T}: Target attacking creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', '{R}, Sacrifice Boggart Forager: Target player shuffles his or her library.', '{R}: Flamekin Brawler gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{T}, Discard an Elf card: Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of Elves you control.', '{T}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Tar Pitcher deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', '{T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add two mana in any combination of colors to your mana pool. Spend this mana only to play Elemental spells or activated abilities of Elementals.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.', '{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature for each Elf you control.', '{T}: Target Goblin creature you control gets +1/+0 and gains flying until end of turn. Sacrifice that creature at end of turn.', '{T}: Target Merfolk creature gets +1/+1 and gains islandwalk until end of turn.\\n{T}: Target land becomes an Island until end of turn.', '{T}: Target creature gets -X/-0 until end of turn, where X is the number of Merfolk and/or Faeries you control.', '{T}: Target land becomes the basic land type of your choice until end of turn. Play this ability only during your turn.', '{T}: Until end of turn, target Forest becomes an X/X Treefolk creature in addition to its other types, where X is the number of Elves you control.', '{U}: Deeptread Merrow gains islandwalk until end of turn.', '{W}, {T}: Harpoon Sniper deals X damage to target attacking or blocking creature, where X is the number of Merfolk you control.', '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.']
